WEBVTT

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.350
I remember everything now!

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:46.670
I sealed my memories back then, because I didn't want him to take my memories of the Mermaid Princesses!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:50.760
Kaito... remembers everything.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:54.840
The person in front of me that I have to protect...

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:58.820
...is you, Lucia!

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.350
Kaito!

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:18.960
The Allure of the White Feather

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.340
Kaito!

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:46.950
Mikaru?

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:49.330
Why in the world are you dressed like that?

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:52.440
Kaito, please teach me surfing.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.970
Eh? Surfing?

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:58.310
Kaito, don't you know? My body's completely healed!

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.910
{Therefore,} I can go surfing or do just about anything else.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:01.680
{Isn't that }Right?

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:03.970
T-That's...

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:08.490
Kaito, you came! I'm so happy!

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.950
Kaito!

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:16.940
Lucia!

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:21.560
Kaito, I've brought you lunch!

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.400
Ah! Thank you!

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:26.970
K-Kaito! Wait!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.720
Lucia, what's today's lunch?

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:33.680
Onigiri with walleye pollock and fried chicken.

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:36.030
Eh? Not fried chicken again!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.660
Huh? Is that no good?

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:41.620
Just kidding. You make the best fried chicken!

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:44.680
{Goodness, Kaito!}Geez! Kaito, you tease.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:48.610
Sorry about that. I'm really hungry because I didn't eat breakfast this morning.

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:51.090
{I'll go ahead and have it}I'll take what you have, Lucia.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:59.070
Are you all right, Mikaru?

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.910
You shouldn't force yourself {all of a sudden.}so suddenly.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.600
Mikaru? Are you all right?

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:05.840
Mikaru...

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.180
I just feel ill all of a sudden.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.600
Could you take me home, Kaito?

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:17.090
Oh, I guess. Can you grab my shoulders?

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:17.800
Yeah...

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:23.420
I'm going to escort Mikaru home.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.790
{Y-Yes}O-Okay... that's for the best.

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.240
Lucia, wait for me at my place.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.830
I'll be back soon.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:30.750
{I understand.}All right.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:41.640
In the end, Kaito didn't eat the lunch you made him.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.450
You went through all that effort to make it. That's too bad.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.570
Right, Lucia?

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:47.690
Yeah. But...

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:55.600
It's fine. Today is Kaito's birthday party.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.390
We're going to celebrate it together.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:59.300
Oh? I see.

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:02.600
So that's why you were able to shrug it off like that. Goodness, Lucia...

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:03.620
I see.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:08.130
That means that you and Kaito are going to have lovey-dovey time alone together!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.150
{Oh my goodness}Come on, you two!

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.550
It's not going to be a lovey-dovey time!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.160
Ahh!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.090
Moron! Moron!

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:23.780
Okay, we're here, Mikaru.

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:26.130
Go {ahead }and head to your room{ on your own}...

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:28.700
Mikaru...

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:32.150
Don't go, Kaito.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:34.240
Don't leave me alone.

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:36.670
Please? Is that all right?

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:39.350
Please, Kaito.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.020
Mikaru...

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.150
That's enough, Mikaru.

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:51.010
No!

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.430
Don't go, Kaito!

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.700
Stay with me forever!

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.050
Mikaru! What's {it }with you all of a sudden?

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:00.830
Calm down! Calm down, Mikaru!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.850
No! I don't want to let go of your hand!

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:05.960
You belong to me, Kaito!

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:10.200
If you leave me all alone, I'll die!

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.270
I don't care what happens!

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:14.150
Mikaru...

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:24.160
Will you really be satisfied with forcing me to stay with you, Mikaru?

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.250
Yeah, I'll be happy.

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:30.160
But only if you're always with me.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.250
Mikaru...

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.320
What's {it with }all this ruckus?

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:36.380
Rihito-san, I...

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.110
Mikaru...

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.300
Let go of him.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.170
No!

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:45.950
Mikaru!

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.390
No! What are you doing!?

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.120
Stop, Onii-sama!

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.470
Stop it! I don't want to let go!

00:06:56.470 --> 00:07:00.650
I only want Kaito! I only want Kaito! Please!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.980
Onii-sama! Stop!

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:07.190
Kaito's the first boy that I've ever loved!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.840
Please stop!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.090
Onii-sama!

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:15.430
I'm sorry, Kaito.

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.770
Kaito! Kaito!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:18.190
I'll try to calm Mikaru down.

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:20.000
Kaito! Kaito! Kaito...

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:20.000
You go on home.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.140
But, Rihito-san... will you be fine?

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.110
Kaito! Kaito!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.310
Yeah. I'm sorry about all this.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.280
Kaito! Kaito!

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:29.090
Kaito! Kaito! Kaito!

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:29.060
Go on home for today. Please!

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:32.170
I understand, Rihito-san.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:32.200
Kaito! Kaito!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.830
Kaito! Kaito!

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:34.830
Good bye.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:36.740
Wait, Kaito!

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:38.760
Don't go!

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:41.560
Kaito!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.530
NOOOO!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:57.750
Mikaru!

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.140
Mikaru! Stop it{that}!

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:09.510
Calm down and think!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:12.450
What would Kaito think if you did that?

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:17.910
Mikaru, you need to think about the meaning of the word "love."

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:21.630
What are you going to get from doing this?

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:22.760
That's not {the case}true.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:27.250
You just tolerate me.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:34.210
Every time you say things like that, you make {me more and more distant from the outside world!}the outside world more and more distant to me!

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.310
Mikaru...

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.580
I'm always alone!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:39.290
I'm lonely!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.260
It's all your fault, Onii-sama!

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:42.890
Mikaru! Wait!

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:43.580
Mikaru!

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:47.430
Mikaru...

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:56.160
"Why am I the only one forever alone?"

00:11:57.360 --> 00:12:01.600
"Why is it that I {want to experience that}have to endure this pain?"

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.710
That's what you're thinking.

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:04.790
{Who is it?}Who's there?

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:06.870
Suffering. Sadness.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.450
I understand that pain very well.

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:14.050
You've always endured being alone.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:19.230
But now I'll absorb your lonely and sad soul in its entirety.

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:22.320
What is this? There's a voice in my head!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:27.630
If you throw away everything, you can become free.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.410
It's good to be free.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.550
Throw away everything, including your humanity...

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:34.470
No! Stop!

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:36.820
STOP!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:05.190
I've always protected Mikaru since I was young, since she was never in good health.

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:08.690
This is what I'm supposed to do as an elder brother.

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:13.410
Mother...

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:25.760
Now that I think about it, Mother wouldn't overly dote on Mikaru.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:29.720
A key?

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.280
This is... the key that Mother treasured.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:37.550
Could it be...

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.710
{Could it be}Is it the key to this box?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:46.940
{However, }Mother never let us see what was in here, though.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.280
T-This is...

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.050
Mikaru!

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:04.960
Hold it right there, Mikaru!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.140
Where are you going!?

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:08.230
Don't get in my way! Let go of me!

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:10.370
That's enough, Mikaru!

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:16.880
I'm not your doll!

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:20.070
I'm not going to listen to you any more!

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:21.780
Leave me alone!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.580
Rihito-san?

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:42.840
Kaito-kun...

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:48.890
I see. Mikaru said those things.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:51.670
I'm a failure as a brother.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.200
Oh no, Rihito-san!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.880
That's not {the case!}true!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:01.290
Kaito-kun, I have a favor to ask.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:03.760
A favor? What is it, Rihito-san?

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:08.840
I would like you to tell Mikaru how you truly feel.

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:13.590
Kaito-kun, you love Lucia-chan, {do you}right?

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:20.170
If Mikaru doesn't clearly hear that from you, she will never give up.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:22.450
Rihito-san...

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:26.500
I was always afraid of hurting Mikaru.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:33.620
Because of that, I kept avoiding the issue in my heart without knowing.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:39.490
But now, Mikaru probably won't listen to anything that I say anymore.

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:43.600
So, Kaito-kun, could you meet Mikaru once more?

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:47.430
I want you to clearly tell her...

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:50.080
...your true feelings.

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:53.430
Tell her that you don't love her.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:16:00.570
If she hears it from you, she will definitely suffer greatly.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:02.160
She'll be really sad.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:07.540
But Mikaru needs to go through this.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:09.790
I'm sorry!

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:13.950
I know I have no right to ask you to do this.

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:18.820
I know that I have the duty to console Mikaru.

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:21.880
Just think of me as a useless man.

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:24.740
Laugh at {me, as I'm an useless brother!}how worthless a brother I am.

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:31.020
But... please, if you would...

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:34.410
Rihito-san, don't do that! Lift your head!

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:36.430
Please, Kaito-kun.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.930
Where did Mikaru go?

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:02.740
Mikaru!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.030
What are you doing, Mikaru!?

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:09.740
Don't do something stupid!

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.190
Kaito?

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:15.150
Kaito.

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:16.960
Kaito!

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:20.380
I knew it, Kaito!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:23.030
I knew that you would definitely find me!

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:24.790
I knew you'd definitely save me!

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:25.760
Mikaru...

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:28.620
I'll never be separated from you ever again!

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:32.070
Kaito, what's that?

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.320
No, uh...

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.990
You bought that to eat with Lucia, didn't you?

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:44.520
What are you doing, Mikaru!?

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:47.660
Why did you pick Lucia over me!?

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:50.110
Why? Why!?

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.280
Mikaru.

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:57.150
Mikaru, I have something that I have to say to you.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.680
Something to say? What do you want to say?

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.750
Mikaru, I...

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:05.220
It's not about you, it's about Lucia...

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:07.900
Stop! I don't want to hear it!

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:10.580
Mikaru, you can't do that!

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:11.850
Listen to me!

00:18:11.850 --> 00:18:15.020
No! No! I absolutely refuse!

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:16.450
Listen to me, Mikaru!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.280
NO!

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.820
T-This is...

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.570
That's Mikeru! Why is he here?

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:56.030
Who am I?

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.050
What kind of a being am I!?

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:02.380
This person... this person's existence has caused me trouble!

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:04.300
She's caused me pain!

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:07.360
She puts my existence in jeopardy!

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:08.710
Mikaru is doing that?

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:10.550
What's he talking about?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:15.090
I will find out what kind of a being I am.

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:22.570
{For the purpose of escaping}In order to escape from this suffering and to make my power more perfect...

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:27.240
...this person is {a roadblock!}in my way!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.300
How's that? Does it hurt?

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:31.890
Does it make you sad?

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:37.630
If you can {remove that power}release that energy from your body, though, you'll be free.

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:42.220
So throw away everything and {merge}become one with me!

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:45.130
You can be free of your soul this way!

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:51.510
STOP!

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:01.340
Just a bit more, and I would've got her...

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:11.240
Why is Mikeru going after Mikaru?

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:13.200
Mikaru!

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:18.870
Mikaru? Are you all right?

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:20.430
Hang in there, Mikaru!

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:25.860
I'm... alone...

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:29.360
I'm always... alone...

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:33.060
Mikaru...

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:38.210
I'm always... alone...

00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:54.650
I've known {this }for a long time.

00:23:54.650 --> 00:23:58.680
There's some unknown thing inside my body.

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:01.720
It's like I'm no longer myself.

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:06.720
Now, {reincarnate}be reborn... my other self!

00:24:06.720 --> 00:24:08.560
No! What is this?

00:24:08.560 --> 00:24:10.240
Save me, Kaito!

00:24:11.060 --> 00:24:14.800
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:15.080 --> 00:24:16.760
In Exchange of a Farewell.

00:24:17.070 --> 00:24:19.770
A person like me is better off disappearing!
